  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Water &amp; Sanitation JWSSPS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water &amp; Sanitation Phase2 - Joint Partner Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med JWSSPS &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja V&amp;S-sektorn att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra dess effektivitet f&#xf6;r att n&#xe5; resultat och medverka till  fattigdomsavveckling och b&#xe4;ttre h&#xe4;lsa f&#xf6;r ugandier. Sverige st&#xf6;djer sektorn med 145 MSEK f&#xf6;r perioden 2008-2010 och fasar ut detta st&#xf6;d under 2010 i enlighet med landstrategin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the JWSSPS is to support the water and sanitation sector to improve its fiscal and physical effectiveness so as to efficiently achieve its targets and contribute to poverty eradication and better health for Ugandans.Sweden will support the sector with 145 MSEK for the period 2008-2010 and will phase out its support in 2010 in accordance with the country strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
